#org @DESC_NIGHTDAZE
The user releases a\npitch-black blast\nat its target. May\nalso lower target's\naccuracy.

#org @DESC_ECHOEDVOICE
The user attacks\nthe target with a\nharsh echo.\nIf used every turn,\npower increases.

#org @DESC_LANDSWRATH
