The foe is shot with\narrows that has a high\ncrit ratio and may lower\nthe foe's DEFENSE\nor flinch it.

#org @DESC_INFERNAL_PARADE
Myriad fireballs that\nmay burn hit the foe.\nIts power doubles if\nthe foe is burned.

#org @DESC_CEASELESS_EDGE
The foe is slashed.\nThis leaves behind\nspikes.

#org @DESC_BLEAKWIND_STORM
The user attacks\nwith savagely cold\nwinds. This may\nlower foe's SPEED.

#org @DESC_WILDBOLT_STORM
The user savagely\nattacks with wind\nand lightning. This\nmay cause paralysis.

#org @DESC_SANDSEAR_STORM
The user attacks\nwith fierce winds\nand hot sand. This\nmay cause a burn.

#org @DESC_SPRINGTIDE_STORM
The user attacks\nwith love and hate.\nThis may lower\nthe foe's ATTACK.

#org @DESC_LUNAR_BLESSING
The user heals statuses\nand\nrestores HP of itself\nand its allies.

#org @DESC_TAKE_HEART
The user heals its\nown statuses and\nraises its SP. ATK\nand SP. DEF.

#org @DESC_ZIPPYZAP
The user attacks the\ntarget with bursts of\nelectricity at high\nspeed. This move\nalways goes first and\nresults in a critical hit.

#org @DESC_SPLISHYSPLASH
The user charges a\nhuge wave with electricity\nand hits the opposing\nPOK\eMON with the wave.\nThis may also leave\nthe foe with paralysis.

#org @DESC_FLOATYFALL
The user floats in the\nair, and then dives at\na steep angle to attack\nthe target. This may\nalso make the target\nflinch.

#org @DESC_PIKAPAPOW
The more PIKACHU loves\nits trainer, the greater\nthe move's power. It\nnever misses.

#org @DESC_BOUNCYBUBBLE
The user attacks by\nshooting water bubbles\nat the target. It then\nabsorbs water and heals\nHP equal to half\nthe damage dealt.

#org @DESC_BUZZYBUZZ
The user shoots a jolt\nof electricity to\nattack the target.\nThis also leaves the\ntarget with paralysis.

#org @DESC_SIZZLYSLIDE
The user cloaks itself\nin fire and charges at\nthe target. This also\nleaves the target with\na burn.

#org @DESC_GLITZYGLOW
The user bombards the\ntarget with force.\nA wall of light is\nput up to weaken the\nopposing POK\eMON's\nspecial moves.

#org @DESC_BADDYBAD
The user acts bad and\nattacks the target.\nA wall of light is\nput up to weaken the\nopposing POK\eMON's\nphysical moves.

#org @DESC_SAPPYSEED
The user grows a\ngigantic stalk to\nscatter seeds. The\nseeds drain the\ntarget's HP every\nsingle turn.

#org @DESC_FREEZYFROST
The user attacks with\na crystal made of cold\nfrozen haze. It clears\nall stat changes for\nevery POK\eMON on the\nfield.

#org @DESC_SPARKLYSWIRL
The user attacks by\nwrapping a foe with a\nwhirlwind of an immense\nscent. This also heals\nstatus conditions of the\nuser's party.

#org @DESC_VEEVEEVOLLEY
The more EEVEE\nloves its trainer,\nthe greater the\nmove's power.\nIt never misses.

#org @DESC_TERABLAST
If TERASTALLIZED,\nthe user unleashes\nTERA energy. This\ndamages using the\nhigher ATTACK or\nSP. ATK stat.

#org @DESC_SILKTRAP
The user spins a silken\ntrap. This protects from\ndamage and lowers the\nSPEED of any attacker\nmaking contact.

#org @DESC_AXEKICK
The user attacks with\na high kick. It may\nconfuse the target.\nIf it misses,\nthe user takes\ndamage instead.

#org @DESC_LASTRESPECTS
The user attacks\nto avenge allies.\nEach fainted ally\nin the party\ngreatly boosts\nmove power.

#org @DESC_LUMINACRASH
The user attacks with\na peculiar light that\naffects the mind.\nThis also harshly\nlowers the target's\nSP. DEF stat.

#org @DESC_ORDERUP
The user attacks with\nelegant poise. If the\nuser has a TATSUGIRI in\nits mouth, this move\nboosts a stat depending\non the TATSUGIRI's form.

#org @DESC_JETPUNCH
The user summons a\ntorrent around its fist\nand punches at blinding\nspeed. This move always\ngoes first.

#org @DESC_SPICYEXTRACT
The user emits an\nincredibly spicy extract,\nsharply boosting target's\nATTACK stat and harshly\nlowering target's\nDEFENSE stat.

#org @DESC_SPINOUT
The user spins furiously\nby straining its legs,\ninflicting damage on the\nfoe. This also harshly\nlowers the user's SPEED\nstat.

#org @DESC_POPULATIONBOMB
The user's fellows\ngather in droves to\nperform a combo attack\nthat hits the target\none to ten times in\na row.

#org @DESC_ICESPINNER
The user is covered in\nthin ice and twirls\naround, slamming into\nthe target. This move's\nspinning motion also\ndestroys the terrain.

#org @DESC_GLAIVERUSH
The user performs a\nreckless charge. In\nthe next turn, attacks\non the user cannot miss\nand will inflict double\ndamage.

#org @DESC_REVIVALBLESSING
The user bestows a\nloving bless, reviving\na party POK\eMON that has\nfainted and restoring\nhalf that POK\eMON's\nmax HP.

#org @DESC_SALTCURE
The user salt cures\nthe target, inflicting\ndamage every turn.\nSTEEL and WATER types\nare more strongly\naffected by this move.

#org @DESC_TRIPLEDIVE
The user performs a\nperfectly timed triple\ndive, hitting the target\nwith splashes of water\nthree times in a row.

#org @DESC_MORTALSPIN
The user performs a\nspin attack that frees\nthe user from hazards.\nThis also poisons\nopposing POK\eMON.

#org @DESC_DOODLE
The user captures the\nvery essence of the foe\nin a sketch. This changes\nthe abilities of the\nuser and its allies to\nthat of the target.

#org @DESC_FILLETAWAY
The user sharply boosts\nits ATTACK, SP. ATK,\nand SPEED stats by using\nits own HP.

#org @DESC_KOWTOWCLEAVE
The user slashes at the\ntarget after kowtowing\nto make the target let\ndown its guard. This\nattack never misses.

#org @DESC_FLOWERTRICK
The user throws a rigged\nbouquet of flowers at\nthe target. This attack\nnever misses and always\nlands a critical hit.

#org @DESC_TORCHSONG
User blows out raging\nflames as if singing\na song, scorching the\ntarget. This also boosts\nthe user's SP. ATK stat.

#org @DESC_AQUASTEP
The user toys with the\ntarget and attacks it\nusing fluid dance steps.\nThis also boosts the\nuser's SPEED stat.

#org @DESC_RAGINGBULL
This move's type depends\non the user's form.\nIt can also break\nbarriers, such as\nLIGHT SCREEN and REFLECT.

#org @DESC_MAKEITRAIN
The user attacks by\nthrowing out a mass of\ncoins. This also lowers\nthe user's SP. ATK stat.\nMoney is earned after\nthe battle.

#org @DESC_PSYBLADE
The user rends the\ntarget with an ethereal\nblade. This move's power\nis boosted if the user\nis on ELECTRIC TERRAIN.

#org @DESC_HYDROSTEAM
The user blasts the foe\nwith boiling-hot water.\nThis move's power is not\nlowered in sunlight\nbut rather boosted.

#org @DESC_RUINATION
The user summons a\nruinous disaster. This\ncuts the target's HP\nin half.

#org @DESC_COLLISIONCOURSE
The user transforms\nand crashes to the\nground. This move's power\nis boosted more than\nusual if it’s a\nsupereffective hit.

#org @DESC_ELECTRODRIFT
The user pierces its\ntarget with futuristic\nelectricity. This move's\npower is boosted more\nthan usual if it's a\nsupereffective hit.

#org @DESC_SHEDTAIL
The user creates a\nsubstitute for itself\nusing its own HP before\nswitching places with\na party POK\eMON in\nwaiting.

#org @DESC_CHILLYRECEPTION
The user tells a\nchillingly bad joke\nbefore switching places\nwith an ally in waiting.\nThis summons a snowstorm\nlasting five turns.

#org @DESC_TIDYUP
The user tidies up and\nremoves the effects of\nhazards and SUBSTITUTE.\nThis also boosts the\nuser's ATTACK and SPEED\nstats.

#org @DESC_POUNCE
The user attacks by\npouncing on the target.\nThis also lowers the\ntarget's SPEED stat.

#org @DESC_TRAILBLAZE
The user attacks\nsuddenly as if leaping\nout from tall grass.\nThe user's nimble\nfootwork boosts its\nSPEED stat.

#org @DESC_CHILLINGWATER
The user attacks the\ntarget by showering it\nwith water that's so\ncold it saps the target's\npower. This also lowers\nthe target's ATTACK stat.

#org @DESC_HYPERDRILL
The user spins its body\nat high speed to pierce\nthe target. This attack\ncan hit a target using\na move such as PROTECT\nor DETECT.

#org @DESC_TWINBEAM
The user shoots mystical\nbeams from its eyes to\ninflict damage. The\ntarget is hit twice in\na row.

#org @DESC_RAGEFIST
The user converts its\nrage into energy. The\nmore times the user has\nbeen hit by attacks,\nthe greater the move's\npower.

#org @DESC_ARMORCANNON
The user shoots its own\narmor out as blazing\nprojectiles. This also\nlowers the user's\nDEFENSE and SP. DEF\nstats.

#org @DESC_BITTERBLADE
The user focuses its\nbitter feelings into\na slashing attack. The\nuser's HP is restored\nby up to half the damage dealt.

#org @DESC_DOUBLESHOCK
The user discharges\nelectricity from its body\nto perform a high-damage\nattack. Afterwards,\nthe user will no longer\nbe ELECTRIC type.

#org @DESC_GIGATONHAMMER
The user swings its\nwhole body around to\nattack with its huge\nhammer. This move can't\nbe used twice in a row.

#org @DESC_COMEUPPANCE
The user retaliates\nwith much greater force\nagainst the opponent\nthat last inflicted\ndamage on it.

#org @DESC_AQUACUTTER
The user expels water\nto cut at the target\nlike a blade. This move\nhas a heightened chance\nof landing a critical\nhit.

#org @DESC_BLAZINGTORQUE
A powerful attack.\nMay leave the target\nburned.

#org @DESC_WICKEDTORQUE
A powerful attack.\nMay put the target to\nsleep.

#org @DESC_NOXIOUSTORQUE
A powerful attack.\nMay leave the target\npoisoned.

#org @DESC_COMBATTORQUE
A powerful attack.\nMay leave the target\nparalyzed.

#org @DESC_MAGICALTORQUE
A powerful attack.\nMay leave the target\nconfused.

#org @DESC_BLOODMOON
The user unleashes the\nfull brunt of its spirit\nfrom a full moon that\nshines as red as blood.\nCan't be used twice\nin a row.

#org @DESC_MATCHAGOTCHA
The user fires a blast\nof tea that it mixed.\nThe user's HP is\nrestored by up to half\nthe damage dealt. May\nleave the foe burned.

#org @DESC_SYRUPBOMB
The user sets off an\nexplosion of candy syrup,\nwhich coats the foe and\ncauses its SPEED stat\nto drop each turn for\nthree turns.

#org @DESC_IVYCUDGEL
The user strikes with\nan ivy-wrapped cudgel.\nThis move's type depends\non the mask worn. Has\na high critical hit\nratio.

#org @DESC_ELECTROSHOT
User gathers electricity\non the first turn,\nboosting its SP. ATK\nstat, then fires a shot\non the next. Fires\nimmediately in rain.

#org @DESC_TERASTARSTORM
The user bombards with\ncrystal power. When used\nby TERAPAGOS in STELLAR\nFORM, this move damages\nall opposing POK\eMON.

#org @DESC_FICKLEBEAM
The user shoots a beam\nof light. Sometimes all\nthe user's heads shoot\nbeams in unison,\ndoubling the move's\npower.

#org @DESC_BURNINGBULWARK
The user's intensely\nhot fur protects it\nfrom attacks and also\nburns any attacker that\nmakes direct contact.

#org @DESC_THUNDERCLAP
This move enables the\nuser to attack first\nwith electricity jolt.\nThis move fails if the\ntarget is not readying\nan attack.

#org @DESC_MIGHTYCLEAVE
The user wields the\nlight to cleave the\ntarget. This move hits\neven if the target\nprotects itself.

#org @DESC_TACHYONCUTTER
The user attacks by\nlaunching blades at the\ntarget twice in a row.\nThis attack never misses.

#org @DESC_HARDPRESS
The target is crushed\nwith a limb to inflict\ndamage. The more HP the\ntarget has left, the\ngreater the move's power.

#org @DESC_DRAGONCHEER
The user raises its\nallies' morale with\na draconic cry, raising\ntheir critical hit ratio.\nDRAGON types are more\naffected.

#org @DESC_ALLURINGVOICE
The user attacks with\nits angelic voice. This\nalso confuses the foe\nif its stats have been\nboosted during the turn.

#org @DESC_TEMPERFLARE
Spurred by desperation,\nthe user attacks the\ntarget. This move's\npower is doubled if the\nuser's previous move\nfailed.

#org @DESC_SUPERCELLSLAM
The user electrifies\nits body and drops onto\nthe target. If this\nmove misses, the user\ntakes damage instead.

#org @DESC_PSYCHICNOISE
User attacks the foe\nwith unpleasant sound\nwaves. For two turns,\nthe target is prevented\nfrom recovering HP.

#org @DESC_UPPERHAND
The user strikes with\nthe heel of its palm,\nmaking the foe flinch.\nFails if the target is\nnot readying a priority\nmove.

#org @DESC_MALIGNANTCHAIN
The user pours toxins\ninto the target by\nwrapping them in a toxic,\ncorrosive chain. This\nmay also leave the\ntarget badly poisoned.

#org @DESC_NIHILLIGHT
The user unleashes\npowerful light that\ndefies laws of nature,\nstriking even FAIRY\ntypes and ignoring any\nstat changes.

#org @DESC_MAX_GUARD
Enables the user to\nevade all attacks.\nIt may fail if used\nin succession.

