#org @DESC_G_MAX_RAPID_FLOW
G-Max Rapid Strike\nUrshifu's signature move.\nIt bypasses the\nuse of Max Guard.

#org @DESC_MEGAHORN
A brutal ramming attack\nusing outthrust horns.\nIt has a high critical\nhit ratio.

#org @DESC_SNOWSCAPE
